# Ctrl+G opens the Navigator listing the inbox, Today, bookmarks and projects, each with its open-task count.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Call mom
Work:
	- Send report @due({today})
	- Old thing @done({today})
	Launch:
		- Book venue
Reading @bookmark
	- Dune
	- Emma
END
keys <C-g>
see Navigator
see 󰚇 INBOX                                   1 │
see 󰖙 Today                                   1 │
see Bookmarks
see Reading                                   2 │
see Projects
see ▾Work                                      2 │
see Launch                                  1 │
quit
